## GPS Mode
```
ros2 run clearpath_soil_sampler mission_commander \
  --ros-args \
  -p use_gps_mode:=true \
  -p field_polygon_gps:="[55.123400, 9.654300, 55.123400, 9.654600, 55.123200, 9.654600, 55.123200, 9.654300]" \
  -p row_spacing:=5.0 \
  -p point_spacing:=5.0 \
  -p output_csv:=/home/tobi/missions/field_results.csv

```


### Cartesian Mode 
```

ros2 run clearpath_soil_sampler mission_commander \
  --ros-args \
  -p use_gps_mode:=false \
  -p cartesian_width:=20.0 \
  -p cartesian_height:=20.0 \
  -p row_spacing:=5.0 \
  -p point_spacing:=5.0
```